def widening_finds_an_explicit_template_instantiation(t):
	"""A file whose only definitions are template instantiations.

    section 15 recorded this as untested and it was broken. `extern template` in a
    header leaves a plain undefined reference, satisfied by exactly one
    translation unit -- conventionally a file that instantiates them for the
    whole project, with no header of its own, so the include graph never
